{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOING TO SCHOOL WITH LIRA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you ever make it to class? There's no rush, but there are plenty of strange obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Going To High School with Lira is a relaxed and peculiar 2D platform game where a simple click of the mouse is all you need. Move at your own pace on a day that started out normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Main Features:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-   **Single-Player Adventure:** Enjoy this absurd, solitary stroll at your own rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-\u00a0 **Simple Controls:** Jump with a mouse click. The challenge isn't speed, but the precision to not fall to the bottom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-  **A Surreal and Peaceful Path:** Your route is plagued by inexplicable yet peaceful obstacles: bananas moving left and right, ice creams and other desserts blocking your path. There are no evil enemies, just a strange world to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not a race, it's a stroll. Your mouse-click precision and your patience will decide how this ordinarily extra-ordinary day ends.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You did it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982420/98514d6e6a250e86d811c0a927adbf9b621b4681.jpg"},{"name":"Steel Commitment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982420/5220635610a8521c9a43f34d83b720fc16193f71.jpg"},{"name":"First jump! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982420/36f90c3a4f2f53b1e8d97eada25143b6bb5a2bb3.jpg"},{"name":" Halfway there","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982420/2a0be0f9690eb04fa6cf7b0bf798dd8d46288636.jpg"},{"name":"Flying Fainting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3982420/65fed1e65e6b8f1b48bef7a3c62e42a40c90c024.jpg"},{"name":"The Law of 